  "p0SimulationNotes": {
    "status": "PROTOTYPE_ONLY",
    "reason": "P0の移動・射撃・有限弾薬・CT・占領・試合終結を回帰試験するための仮値。正式な武器/機体バランスではない。",
    "rules": "平面hitscan、通常射撃は敵のみ。本拠点は繰返し損害を受ける標的。時間切れ同値は引分。味方中継を再出撃候補とし、敵が占領半径にいる間は出撃を停止。補給は本拠点半径内で時間ごとに回復し、CTを短縮しない。帰投チャネル/支援機/核は未実装。",
    "timing": "全機移動→全機の射撃意図→損害一括解決→占領→補給→勝敗。入力のtickはStep前のCurrentTick。"
  },
  "p0BaseDefenseNotes": {
    "status": "PROTOTYPE_ONLY",
    "source": "User request 2026-10-15: base should fire back, slow rate, roughly 70%-of-max-effective-HP damage, as an area attack.",
    "reason": "baseCounterFireDamage=105 = 0.7*(maxHealth 100 + maxShield 50). baseCounterFireIntervalSeconds=5 keeps the rate clearly slower than a unit's own fireIntervalSeconds(0.4s). baseCounterFireRadius=70: the first value (20) never overlapped an attacker in practice because ForwardMarchBotCommandSource's p0BotPrototypeNotes.attackStopRangeFraction(0.9) means a BOT parks ~58.5m from the base (0.9*fireRange 65) to shoot it - raised to 70 (>fireRange 65) so anyone actually within weapon range of the base is also within the base's own return-fire range. User-reported 2026-10-15: counter-fire had no visible effect because of this gap.",
    "notACounter": "This is a static structure's own weapon firing on a cooldown at anyone in range, not a per-unit automatic melee counter/guard-interrupt (AGENTS.md's prohibition is about the latter only).",
    "rules": "Fires at most once per intervalSeconds per base, only once an enemy is actually inside radius (an idle base keeps waiting rather than firing at nothing); damages every enemy unit in radius simultaneously (area attack), through shield then health, same as ordinary unit fire."
  },
  "p0BotPrototypeNotes": {
    "attackStopRangeFraction": 0.9,
    "returnStopSupplyRadiusFraction": 0.5,
    "implementation": "Current P0 BOT uses these as documented constants. This section records assumptions; changing these values alone does not yet reconfigure BOT code.",
    "reason": "本拠点の射程縁で振動せず、帰還時には補給範囲内へ確実に入るための仮係数。AI.Bots独自の設定型でデータ読込する作業を後続に残す。"
  },
